   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of EU legislation for different types of products-study visit in Slovakia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Implement&#xe1;cia legislat&#xed;vy E&#xda; pre r&#xf4;zne druhy v&#xfd;robkov-&#x161;tudijn&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva na Slovensku</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Exchange of information and experience with Slovak institutions, which are responsible for the implementation and application of European directives, compliance with new legal frameworks for trade&#xa0;of goods on the EU market.&#xa0;Information on the&#xa0;PECA contract and preparation of similar contracts of Serbia and the EU.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;V&#xfd;mena inform&#xe1;ci&#xed; a sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; so slovensk&#xfd;mi in&#x161;tit&#xfa;ciami, ktor&#xe9; s&#xfa; zodpovedn&#xe9; za oblas&#x165; implement&#xe1;cie a uplat&#x148;ovania eur&#xf3;pskych smern&#xed;c, dodr&#x17e;iavanie nov&#xfd;ch pr&#xe1;vnych r&#xe1;mcov v oblasti obchodu s v&#xfd;robkami na trhu E&#xda;. Zdie&#x13e;anie&#xa0;inform&#xe1;ci&#xed; o v&#xfd;zname PECA zmluvy a pr&#xed;prava podobnej zmluvy Srbska a E&#xda;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
